WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.800
The compact product editor brings the essential work together.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:11.700
Edit one content language while keeping the native product context.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:17.800
Arrange the product media and inspect the selected image.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:23.700
Image captions follow the same shop content language.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:29.800
Review the effective title, page URL and description as you edit.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:35.700
Product content and language inheritance keep the defaults connected.

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:41.800
Select related products from the same native catalogue.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:47.700
The storefront resolves the selected products in its channel context.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:53.800
The customer sees product media, content, price and available sizes.

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:59.700
The selected variant continues into the same native basket.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:05.800
Select the page section and edit with the preview beside you.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:11.700
The shop editor keeps its tools, agent and private draft together.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:17.800
A private content edit is reviewed through the existing release path.

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:23.700
Only the selected product content is published to the live shop.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:29.800
The saved product history provides a route back to earlier content.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:35.700
An explicit restore creates a new revision and preserves stock ownership.
